    mc "哈哈，说真的，我没料到今天会这样收场。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:181
translate chinese dayevent_d0bffd3c:

    # mc "It’s tragic to part, but I believe we both have places to be."
    mc "欢乐的时光总是短暂，但我想我们都有自己该去的地方，是时候该说再见了。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:183
translate chinese dayevent_463c1c0d:

    # ros "Say it ain’t so… But this is a moment in time I’ll certainly never forget."
    ros "别这样说嘛…不过，这一刻我是永远不会忘记的。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:186
translate chinese postros1_710eb078:

    # ros "I hope we’ll see each other again sometime, [mc]!"
    ros "希望以后还能再见，[mc]！"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:188
translate chinese postros1_5001abd9:

    # "I returned to the apartment to rest."
    "我回到公寓休息。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:191
translate chinese postros1_38830ba9:

    # ros "Ah, thanks! Take care, stranger."
    ros "啊，谢谢！多保重，陌生的朋友。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:202
translate chinese postros1_08cd7a26:

    # "As I navigate through a bustling marketplace, far larger and more exhausting than any I've visited before, I spot exactly what I'm looking for."
    "我穿行于一座熙熙攘攘的集市之中，它比我之前去过的任何一座集市都大得多，走起来也累人，但好在我终于找到了我想要的东西。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:203
translate chinese postros1_fe05065c:

    # "Donuts! [mox] loves these, so I'll buy some as a treat."
    "甜甜圈！我记得[mox]最爱吃这个了，买些当礼物吧。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:204
translate chinese postros1_6354fc0d:

    # "As I make my purchase, the distracted merchant accidentally hands me a $20 bill back instead of $5. I'm briefly excited by this realization, but..."
    "摊主找零时心不在焉，误把$20当$5递给我。我发现时心头一喜，但…"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:210
translate chinese postros1_6ee00058:

    # "Temptation tugs at me. After all, no one would notice. With the marketplace this busy, the merchant's coffers must be overflowing."
    "内心中的邪念在诱惑着我，毕竟没有人会注意到这种小事，毕竟集市现在这么的热闹。而且我猜生意这么好的店主现在也不差这点钱。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:211
translate chinese postros1_efbba48b:

    # "With a subtle glance around, I discreetly pocket the extra change, rationalizing it as a stroke of good luck amid the chaos."
    "我悄悄环顾四周，不动声色地将多找的钞票塞进背包之中，把这当作混乱中意外的好运。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:213
translate chinese postros1_d3f9cee8:

    # "My sense of honesty compels me to do the right thing. Despite the allure of extra coins, I gently alert the merchant to the mistake and exchange the $20 bill for the correct amount."
    "钱很诱人，这不假，但内心的诚实驱使我做出正确选择。我轻声提醒了商家的失误，将$20换回正确的找零。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:214
translate chinese postros1_c9d6553a:

    # "As a bonus for the honesty, he thanks me, hands me a crumpled stack of three $1 bills then continues frantically working."
    "作为诚实的奖励，他道谢后塞给我三张皱巴巴的$1钞票，又继续忙得团团转。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:224
translate chinese postros1_bea835fc:

    # "Strolling down a bustling street, I notice something on the pavement, partially obscured by fallen leaves."
    "沿着繁华街道漫步时，我注意到人行道上有样东西半掩在落叶下。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:225
translate chinese postros1_13a2d3a5:

    # "When I bend down to investigate, my heart skips a beat—I’ve found a lost bag."
    "弯腰细看时，我的心跳漏了一拍——有谁不小心丢了个手包。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:226
translate chinese postros1_df1a43fd:

    # "Inside, I find crisp bills neatly tucked away. My fingers brush the smooth surface of the currency, and I count $100 in total. What luck!"
    "包里塞着一叠整齐的钞票，指尖抚过光滑的票面清点出$100。真是天降横财！"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:227
translate chinese postros1_321e0c51:

    # "But then, I find something unexpected—a slip of paper with a nearby return address, important cards, and a small photo of a mare with purple sunglasses."
    "但随后发现了意外之物——一张写着附近回邮地址的纸条、重要证件，还有戴紫色太阳镜的雌驹照片。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:228
translate chinese postros1_25a014c8:

    # mc "Aaahhh… Damn…"
    mc "唉…这…"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:229
translate chinese postros1_cc58f7a4:

    # "Returning the bag means giving up its contents…"
    "归还手包就意味着放弃里面的财物……"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:232
translate chinese postros1_736c0383:

    # "In the end, I know what I must do. With a heavy sigh, I resolve to do the right thing, no matter how difficult."
    "最终我明白该怎么做。沉重地叹了口气，我决心无论怎样都要做正确的事。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:233
translate chinese postros1_bde549c5:

    # "Clutching the bag tightly, I make my way to the nearby address and return it to its rightful owner."
    "我紧攥着手包找到附近的地址，将它归还给失主。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:235
translate chinese postros1_6295722b:

    # cla "Oh! Thank you! Thank you so much!"
    cla "天啊！谢谢！真的太感谢了！"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:236
translate chinese postros1_4a2edc3c:

    # mc "Ah… You’re!"
    mc "啊…你是！"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:238
translate chinese postros1_e28e661a:

    # cla "My goodness, I thought I'd lost this! My cards, IDs, photos! I don't know what I would have done if..."
    cla "天哪，我以为这些都丢定了！我的银行卡、证件、照片！要是真找不到我真不知道该怎么办……"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:240
translate chinese postros1_c361716d:

    # cla "{i}Sigh{/i} Thank you, so much."
    cla "{i} 呼~{/i}真的太感谢你了。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:252
translate chinese postros1_cd8cdd19:

    # cla "Recognize me? A brothel regular, perhaps?"
    cla "认出我了？莫非您是夜店的常客？"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:253
translate chinese postros1_07e36cf7:

    # mc "Not a regular, but curious."
    mc "不算常客，但确实有点好奇。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:256
translate chinese postros1_1721fe8d:

    # cla "Oh! You're... [mc]! The new host!"
    cla "噢！你是…[mc]！新来的男招待对吧！"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:257
translate chinese postros1_be690860:

    # cla "Thank you, so much, [mc]. This really is a stroke of good fortune."
    cla "太感谢你了[mc]。这真是天赐的好运。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:259
translate chinese postros1_f67b2db5:

    # "She slips me $50 note and winks."
    "她塞给我一张$50钞票，眨了眨眼。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:260
translate chinese postros1_c3e91684:

    # cla "I’ll certainly remember this..."
    cla "我肯定会记住这份心意的…"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:261
translate chinese postros1_a48a9637:

    # cla "Say, I offer a special service at the brothel... If you're interested, you should come see me."
    cla "对了，我在夜店提供特殊服务…有兴趣的话可以来找我。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:262
translate chinese postros1_1976f1f2:

    # cla "Having you as a customer instead of... Well... Let's just say I'm offering a hefty discount~"
    cla "与其服务那些…嗯…不如接待你这样的客户~我会给你打个折扣哦~"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:264
translate chinese postros1_1de5c34b:

    # "(Gained +$50 and a huge discount on [cla]'s services!)"
    "（获得+$50及[cla]服务的巨额折扣！）"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:269
translate chinese postros1_18a1255f:

    # "With a swift motion, I slip the bag into my own. The weight fills it, a tangible reminder of the wealth now in my possession."
    "我迅速将包手包放进了自己的包里，沉甸甸的重量提醒着此刻拥有的财富。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:270
translate chinese postros1_0cf716de:

    # "I continue down the street, wondering what I’ll do with all that money."
    "我继续沿街走着，盘算着笔钱的用途。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:279
translate chinese postros1_8face86d:

    # "Today's a big day. Even I'm feeling nervous as I sit on the first floor of the library and wait for everyone."
    "今天是个重要的日子。我坐在图书馆一楼等大家时，连自己都感到紧张。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:280
translate chinese postros1_5b0c8df1:

    # "[lil] carefully shimmies down the stairs carrying a large stack of books."
    "[lil]抱着一大摞书小心翼翼地挪下楼梯。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:282
translate chinese postros1_8b25ccad:

    # lil "I've read absolutely {i}everything{/i} about the virtues and darkness in preparation for this."
    lil "为了准备这次行动，我几乎{i} 翻遍 {/i}所有关于谐律之元与黑暗的文献。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:284
translate chinese postros1_3cd757ea:

    # lil "I was not expecting there to be such an extensive history! I can't wait to bring this all to the Queen."
    lil "没想到历史记载如此详尽！真期待向女王禀报这些发现。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:285
translate chinese postros1_977ef735:

    # lil "But first, I can't wait to meet all the virtues. Actually, I think I can see someone hovering outside the window right now!"
    lil "不过最迫不及待的是见到所有的谐律之元。啊，窗外好像已经有谁飞来了！"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:287
translate chinese postros1_d267ec50:

    # "I go to look myself and spot [but] awkwardly pacing outside. I almost forgot how shy she could be, so I take the initative and invite her inside."
    "我转头望去，发现[but]正在窗外紧张地踱步。差点忘了她有多害羞，于是我主动邀请她进来。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:290
translate chinese postros1_4de9e65e:

    # but "Uhm, h-hi!"
    but "呃，你-你好！"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:292
translate chinese postros1_9ee95969:

    # lil "Oh, you! You're the alchemist that appeared recently! I didn't realize you were one of the Virtues!"
    lil "啊，是你！最近出现的那个炼金术士！没想到你也是谐律之元之一！"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:294
translate chinese postros1_981eaf59:

    # but "Wait... You're the one who's been buying my potions?"
    but "等等…一直买我药水的马就是你？"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:298
translate chinese postros1_064b7200:

    # "[lil] and [but] hit it off effortlessly, and even though they should technically be the most socially awkward of the group, the tension is eased immediately."
    "[lil]和[but]瞬间融洽相处，尽管理论上她俩本该是团队里最社恐的组合，但现在紧张气氛却立刻消融了。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:299
translate chinese postros1_203f1ba0:

    # "Their nerdy conversation about alchemy gets so intense that they actually miss the second arrival."
    "她们关于炼金术的学术讨论如此投入，以至于完全没注意到第二位来客。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:301
translate chinese postros1_8d8516d6:

    # hon "Sorry if I’m late! Had to finish a few things back at the farm before heading over."
    hon "抱歉来迟了！出发前得先把农场的活儿干完。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:304
translate chinese postros1_9174aebf:

    # lily "Ah, [hon], right? Sheesh, you look strong! We’re assembling quite the team here."
    lily "啊，你是[hon]对吧？天呐，你看上去真强壮！我们这个团队可真不简单。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:305
translate chinese postros1_86748650:

    # mc "Yep, they're all incredible women."
    mc "没错，每一个都是了不起的雌驹。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:307
translate chinese postros1_e37dfad2:

    # hon "Aw, shucks. I’m just a humble farmer who happens to be incredibly jacked."
    hon "哎哟，过奖啦。我就是个碰巧练得特别壮实的普通农妇。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:309
translate chinese postros1_a2e53bf4:

    # "A ripple of laughter flows through the room, lightening the atmosphere just in time for the next arrivals."
    "一阵轻笑掠过房间，正好为下一位到来者营造了轻松氛围。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:312
translate chinese postros1_5d9e20e4:

    # "[rub] enters with a confident smile, her intelligent eyes surveying everyone as if already sizing up her team."
    "[rub]带着自信的微笑走进来，聪慧的目光扫过了我们，仿佛已在评估团队实力。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:315
translate chinese postros1_94593195:

    # "And as if they came in together, behind her is [bla], who comes with a box of pastries that fills the room with a warm, inviting smell."
    "紧随其后的[bla]宛如同行般端着糕点盒进来，糕点的香气瞬间弥漫整个房间。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:317
translate chinese postros1_10998f3f:

    # rub "So, this is the gathering of the Virtues I’ve been hearing so much about. Quite the crowd already."
    rub "原来这就是传闻中的谐律之元集会，已经聚集了不少马了呢。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:319
translate chinese postros1_35e3719f:

    # bla "I hope so! Brought a little something for everyone! Figured it’d help break the ice."
    bla "希望如此！给大家带了点小礼物！想着能活跃下气氛。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:327
translate chinese postros1_ca7cc4ff:

    # "As everyone begins munching on the pastries, a more relaxed vibe settles over the group. [but] shyly thanks her for the treat, and [hon] is already asking if [bla] takes orders."
    "大家开始享用糕点时，氛围明显轻松起来。[but]腼腆地道谢，[hon]已经在问[bla]是否接受订制订单。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:333
translate chinese postros1_ec34dfbc:

    # "Just as they’re finishing, [rik], the final member, slips in quietly. There’s a flicker of hesitation in her eyes, but she quickly hides it with a confident grin."
    "正当点心快要吃完时，最后一位成员[rik]悄然而至。她眼中闪过一丝犹豫，但迅速用自信的笑容掩盖过去。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:335
translate chinese postros1_e3b558ae:

    # rik "Typical that the person known for their speed arrives last."
    rik "以速度闻名的马居然最后到，好熟悉的桥段。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:336
translate chinese postros1_edfc380b:

    # mc "You're right on time, [rik]. We were just getting to the main point."
    mc "来得正好[rik]，我们刚要进入正题。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:339
translate chinese postros1_8a24b08a:

    # "With everyone settled, I take a deep breath, scanning their faces one by one. They each have unique strengths, but they’ve all faced struggles."
    "待众人安定后，我深吸一口气逐一扫过她们的面容。每匹雌驹都拥有独特的力量，也都经过了考验。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:340
translate chinese postros1_98d5bb3b:

    # "I’ve helped each of them in their own way, and now they’re here because they trust me. I can only hope they’ll trust this mission as well."
    "我曾以不同方式帮助过她们每匹马，此刻的相聚源于信任。唯愿她们也能同样信任这项使命。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:343
translate chinese postros1_19c03845:

    # lil "Ladies. We’re here because of something bigger than any one of us."
    lil "女士们，我们在此相聚，是因为我们肩负着超越个体的崇高使命。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:345
translate chinese postros1_1d5474b2:

    # lil "I’ve read through countless texts and deciphered the legends. You may have heard whispers too, about a historic group of warriors only known as the Virtues of Concord."
    lil "我研读了无数典籍，破译了古老传说。或许你也曾听闻过那些传言，一支以“谐律之元”为名的传奇团队。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:347
translate chinese postros1_1409b39e:

    # lil "I believe each of us possesses a trait that embodies the power, and we can utilize it to help the Queen push back against the darkness creeping into our lands."
    lil "我相信我们都拥有象征这种力量的品质，能借此协助女王击退侵蚀国土的黑暗。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:350
translate chinese postros1_c4f2a882:

    # rik "Now I've heard about this before, but I don't exactly have any magic or special 'power'."
    rik "我确实听说过，但我既不会魔法也没什么特殊\"能力\"。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:353
translate chinese postros1_6038da51:

    # rub "I think it goes beyond mere unicorn magic. Isn't it a blessing from the queen herself?"
    rub "我认为这远不止魔法。难道是女王亲自赐予的祝福？"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:354
translate chinese postros1_5b38d263:

    # "[lil] awkwardly scratches her head as she flicks through a book in front of her."
    "[lil]尴尬地挠着头，快速翻动面前的书本。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:355
translate chinese postros1_9aa85f01:

    # lil "You know, I'm not quite sure... The origin was never... specified..."
    lil "其实我也不太确定…起源从未…明确记载…"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:363
translate chinese postros1_641a4471:

    # but "There {i}is{/i} some special power, right? We can't exactly help the Queen in this state."
    but "我们总{i}该有{/i}某种特殊的力量吧？现在这样可帮不了女王。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:365
translate chinese postros1_823076e0:

    # hon "Drop the books, [lil], I've heard this one from my grandpaps..."
    hon "别翻书了[lil]，我听我爷爷讲过…"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:367
translate chinese postros1_645b7260:

    # hon "The Virtues got their power by embodying a certain trait they naturally represent, which, when combined, awakened powers beyond what they currently have."
    hon "谐律之元们通过展现各自与生俱来的特质获得力量，这些特质结合后能唤醒他们当前未曾拥有的能力。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:368
translate chinese postros1_1a4d21ac:

    # hon "Now, these were just bedtime stories for me, but I'm willing to put my faith in them."
    hon "虽然对我而言只是睡前故事，但我愿意相信它。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:376
translate chinese postros1_02934be1:

    # lil "Thank you, [hon]! But... there is one complication. I appreciate that we could try to do this on our own, but we'll need approval from the Queen to truly take up this mantle in an official capacity."
    lil "谢谢你，[hon]！不过……还有个棘手的问题。我理解我们可以尝试自行处理此事，但若要正式承担起这个职责，我们仍需获得女王的批准。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:377
translate chinese postros1_805749b0:

    # lil "She may be able to help us awaken these powers."
    lil "或许她能帮助我们唤醒这些力量。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:379
translate chinese postros1_8ab7bee1:

    # rik "Wait a minute. You're saying we've all come here, ready to take on this role... and no one's even talked to the Queen about it yet?"
    rik "等等。你是说我们聚在这里准备承担使命…却还没有马跟女王提过这件事？"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:381
translate chinese postros1_447cac44:

    # "An awkward silence follows as everyone looks at me and [lil] expectantly."
    "一阵尴尬的沉默，大家都带着期望的眼神看向我和[lil]。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:382
translate chinese postros1_f1af11d5:

    # mc "Look, it wasn’t that I didn’t think to ask. I wanted us to come together first, to understand what we’re getting into."
    mc "是这样的，不是我没想过要问。我只是希望我们先达成共识，弄清楚接下来要面对什么。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:383
translate chinese postros1_dd2816d6:

    # mc "I believe in each of you, and if we stand together, the Queen will see why this is necessary."
    mc "我相信你们。只要我们团结一致，女王会明白这件事的必要性。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:391
translate chinese postros1_2dabb670:

    # bla "Well, I’m in. Let’s go up to the castle and show her what we’re made of. If we’re doing this, we’re doing it together, right?"
    bla "好，我加入。咱们这就去城堡向她证明我们的决心。既然要行动，就要同甘共苦，对吧？"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:393
translate chinese postros1_f5e7c0a2:

    # hon "Exactly. Besides, if we have the potential that you say, then surely she’ll see it too."
    hon "没错。况且如果我们真有你所说的潜力，她肯定也能看出来。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:401
translate chinese postros1_846e3e08:

    # lil "Yes, we need to make our case. The Queen will let us help her!"
    lil "对，我们必须阐明立场。女王会允许我们协助她的！"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:402
translate chinese postros1_d6398350:

    # "The decision feels unanimous. I can see the resolve building in each of them. It’s a dangerous mission, but they’re willing to stand by me, just as they have through their own struggles."
    "决议似乎获得一致通过。我能看到每个人眼中逐渐坚定的决心。虽然任务危险，但她们依然愿意站在我身边，正如上一个宇宙一样。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:403
translate chinese postros1_fc1a8da2:

    # "I feel a swell of pride and gratitude for all of us. Reuniting them in this alternative universe has been a remarkable challenge and achievement."
    "自豪与感激在我们之间涌动。在这个错位的宇宙里能让大家重聚，既是巨大的挑战，也是非凡的成就。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:404
translate chinese postros1_e90a4aae:

    # "And now, there's only one thing left to do."
    "而现在，只剩下最后一件事要做了。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:405
translate chinese postros1_ffa61c11:

    # mc "Then it’s decided. We’re going to the castle to speak with the Queen."
    mc "那就这么定了。我们现在就去城堡面见女王。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:406
translate chinese postros1_0d5647fd:

    # "The group exchanges nods, agreeing on a date and time."
    "小组成员纷纷点头，共同商定了行动日期与时间。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:410
translate chinese postros1_c54d08b1:

    # bla "Buuuut... since we're all here... Don't you think it'd only make sense if we spent a day getting to know each other? You know, team cohesion!"
    bla "不—过…既然所有成员都在场…难道不该花一天时间互相了解吗？这可是团队凝聚力的关键啊！"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:411
translate chinese postros1_e7d25b9a:

    # "I see the reactions ripple through the group — [rub]'s raised eyebrow, [but]' shy smile, [hon]'s eager nod. Even [rik], usually ready to jump into action, seems to consider it."
    "我观察到她们的不同反应——[rub]挑眉，[but]抿嘴浅笑，[hon]积极点头。连一向行动派的[rik]都露出思索的表情。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:412
translate chinese postros1_40e6d912:

    # "I have to admit, [bla] has a point. If we’re going to convince the Queen, it wouldn’t hurt to have some solid camaraderie behind us. Plus, a little team bonding might be exactly what we need before facing whatever danger awaits."
    "不得不承认[bla]说得有道理。要说服女王，深厚的团队情谊将会变成助力。况且在迎接未知危险前，互相了解也是我们必要的工作。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:415
translate chinese postros1_47bfb322:

    # hon "Honestly, I’d love a bit of time to actually chat with everyone. It feels like I’m meeting you all for the first time, but somehow… like we’re already connected."
    hon "说实话，我挺想和大家好好聊聊。虽然是初次见面，但总觉得…我们之间早有联系。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:418
translate chinese postros1_0032cd4d:

    # rub "Fine by me. I think [bla] has a good idea here. Strong bonds make for strong allies."
    rub "我没意见。[bla]这主意不错，牢固的情谊才能铸就可靠的同盟。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:426
translate chinese postros1_6f179c58:

    # but "I’d… I’d like that too. It’s a lot easier to work together when we know each other, right?"
    but "我-我也赞成。彼此了解后合作会更顺畅，对吧？"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:427
translate chinese postros1_525799f5:

    # lil "I suppose we can afford a day for this… After all, if we’re going to embody the Virtues of Concord, maybe it starts with us actually being in concord!"
    lil "我想抽出一天时间完全值得…毕竟要体现谐律代表的事物，总得先从我们自身开始！"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:428
translate chinese postros1_d8e22577:

    # rik "Well said. I know a nice spot we can hang out without any trouble. It even has an obstacle course if anyone fancies a warm-up drill or two!"
    rik "说得好。我知道有个清净的好地方，甚至还带障碍训练场，有谁想热身一下的话正合适！"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:429
translate chinese postros1_f32fb56b:

    # mc "Well, I’m convinced. Looks like we’re having a day off before we storm the castle!"
    mc "好吧我被说服了。那我们在去城堡之前先休息一天吧！"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:434
translate chinese postros1_a645151f:

    # "The day’s warmth has spread across the clearing. We’ve set up a little 'camp' of sorts — next to an obstacle course."
    "温暖的日光洒满林间空地。我们在障碍训练场旁搭起了临时营地。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:435
translate chinese postros1_900230b7:

    # "There's a cozy area under a tree where [bla]'s setting up a picnic. It’s a relaxed, playful atmosphere, but I can tell everyone is curious about each other, eager to see what each brings to the table."
    "树荫下有个温馨的角落，[bla]正在那里布置野餐。氛围轻松而充满趣味，我能感觉到每匹雌驹都对彼此充满好奇，都渴望看看对方能带来什么惊喜。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:437
translate chinese postros1_5ca32cf0:

    # bla "Alright, folks! Before we get into anything too intense, let’s start with a little snack. It’s fuel for team spirit!"
    bla "好了各位！在进入正题前，我们先吃点东西补充体力。这可是团队精神的燃料！"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:440
translate chinese postros1_9495bdea:

    # rub "These are incredible, [bla]. You’re practically bribing us to stay on the team!"
    rub "太美味了，[bla]。你简直是在用美食贿赂我们，好让你留在团队里！"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:443
translate chinese postros1_94b82b67:

    # rik "Yeah, keep these coming! I need as much energy as I can to get first place on the obstacle course."
    rik "好耶，再多来点！我得攒足能量，这样才能在障碍赛里拿第一名。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:447
translate chinese postros1_6f09c3e5:

    # hon "Better watch out, [rik]. You’re not the only one with competitive spirit around here."
    hon "小心点[rik]，这儿有好胜心的可不止你一个。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:449
translate chinese postros1_5ff5634e:

    # rik "Hoho, you think you can outspeed me?"
    rik "嚯嚯~，你觉得能比我更快？"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:451
translate chinese postros1_cbbb3e40:

    # hon "Outspeed? No, y'all're a lot faster than I am. But going fast is only half the battle in an course like that, there're plenty of obstacles where my strength will give me an advantage."
    hon "更快？不，你们速度都远胜于我。但在这种赛道上速度只是基础，很多障碍项目我的力量优势会显现出来。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:453
translate chinese postros1_ac5bf1ab:

    # rik "Heh, this body ain't just aerodynamic."
    rik "嘿~，这身板可不只是适合飞行这么简单。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:455
translate chinese postros1_d1f1af91:

    # "It’s amazing to see how easily they’re connecting. Here, among new friends, they’re the brightest I’ve ever seen them."
    "看着他们如此轻松地就交了朋友，真是令我惊叹。在这里，在新的朋友中间，她们展现出了我见过的最耀眼的光彩。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:456
translate chinese postros1_4352e486:

    # "[but] is even visibly more relaxed, sitting cross-legged beside a small bowl as she prepares some simple herbal concoctions."
    "连[but]都明显放松下来，盘腿坐在小碗旁调配着简单的草药制剂。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:458
translate chinese postros1_0e064623:

    # but "I thought I’d show you some basic herbal remedies… This one, even though it uses simple ingredients that can be found anywhere, makes you feel energized. It’s great for early mornings or long journeys."
    but "我想给你介绍几种基础草药配方……这款药方虽然只用随处可得的简单原料，却能让你精神焕发。特别适合清晨时分或长途旅行时使用。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:461
translate chinese postros1_98063294:

    # rub "Really, darling? It just looks like you scrunched up some grass and petals."
    rub "真的，亲爱的？这看起来就像是你把草和花瓣揉成一团而已。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:463
translate chinese postros1_9e218aa8:

    # "[rub] curiously tries some of the juice from the mixture. Lo and behold, she feels energized already."
    "[rub]好奇地尝了尝混合物里的汁液。瞧，她立刻就感觉精力充沛了。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:464
translate chinese postros1_375b1ca1:

    # rub "I take it back, that really is quite something!"
    rub "我收回刚才的话，这确实厉害！"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:467
translate chinese postros1_45783087:

    # lil "Wow, that's handy! If you ever need any hard to get ingredients, let me know - I have some pretty good connections at the castle."
    lil "哇，太实用了！如果需要稀有素材尽管告诉我，我在城堡有些不错的关系。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:469
translate chinese postros1_d96c3a14:

    # but "Yes, that would be wonderful! Maybe we could make something even better together…"
    but "是的，那太棒了！也许我们能一起创造出更厉害的东西……"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:471
translate chinese postros1_a1d962ee:

    # rub "See, we’re already finding ways to work together. And if any of you need a safe place to train or, ahem, celebrate after a victory, my establishment is always open."
    rub "瞧，我们已经开始寻找合作的方式了。要是你们需要个安全的地方训练，或者——咳咳——胜利后庆祝一番，我的店永远为你们敞开大门。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:472
translate chinese postros1_aee20f41:

    # mc "[rub]'s got the right idea. I have a feeling this ‘day off’ will be the start of something important for all of us."
    mc "[rub]的想法很对。我感觉这个“休息日”将成为我们重要征程的起点。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:475
translate chinese postros1_8d4a3e56:

    # rik "Alright, enough lounging around! Everyone up! If we’re going to be heroes, we might as well see what we’re made of. Let’s do some exercises to warm up."
    rik "好了，别再懒懒散散了！大家都起来！既然要当英雄，不如试试自己的本事如何吧。来做些热身运动吧。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:477
translate chinese postros1_6753e032:

    # "[rik] leads us in a series of warm-ups, followed by the obstacle course. At first, there's varying levels of commitment, but soon enough, everyone’s engaged in playful competition, cheering each other on."
    "[rik]带着大家做热身运动，然后开始障碍训练。起初参与度参差不齐，但很快大家都投入进了愉快的竞赛中，互相加油鼓劲。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:478
translate chinese postros1_11a76b78:

    # "The day unfolds with a mixture of laughter and friendship as everyone shares their strengths and quirks. By the time the sun dips below the trees, we’re all tired but happy, and there’s a new sense of purpose and unity among us."
    "随着大家分享各自的优点与怪癖，这一天在欢声笑语与友谊交织中徐徐展开。当夕阳沉入树梢时，我们虽疲惫却心满意足，彼此间已凝聚起崭新的目标感与团结力。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:485
translate chinese postros1_7d2473ae:

    # bla "To the Virtues of Concord! Here’s to standing together against the darkness."
    bla "为谐律之元干杯！为携手对抗黑暗而庆贺。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:494
translate chinese postros1_7ed2c412:

    # misc "To the Virtues of Concord!"
    misc "为和谐美德干杯！"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:497
translate chinese postros1_9e1e8f53:

    # "We raise our mugs together. Whatever lies ahead, we’ll face it together."
    "我们共同举杯。无论前方有何挑战，我们都将共同面对。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:499
translate chinese postros1_8fd6c12e:

    # "(The castle is now available! Enter when you're ready!)"
    "（城堡现已开放！准备好即可进入！）"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:505
translate chinese postros1_fe34f372:

    # "I spent the following days training diligently, bouncing between physical sparring with our tough girls and magical sparring with our casters."
    "接下来几天我刻苦训练，轮流与队里的前锋们进行体能格斗，又和术士们切磋魔法。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:506
translate chinese postros1_b55446d5:

    # "Uniquely, I combined the two to create a style with fewer weaknesses."
    "我独特地将两者结合，形成了一种弱点更少的战斗风格。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:511
translate chinese postros1_c7641b3b:

    # "[hon] may have been stronger, and [rik] faster, but I was able to consistently catch them by surprise using projectiles."
    "[hon]或许更强悍，[rik]或许更迅捷，但我总能用远程攻击出其不意地击败她们。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:514
translate chinese postros1_f1c5142e:

    # "As [rik] dashed towards me, I created a web of magical strands that left her tangled up."
    "当[rik]猛冲而来时，我编织出魔法丝网将她牢牢缠住。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:515
translate chinese postros1_eba7fc15:

    # rik "Woah, now! That’s cheating!"
    rik "喂喂，这算作弊吧！"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:518
translate chinese postros1_dd847c31:

    # "While [hon] prepared her more powerful flurry of blows, I kept her off-balance with a series of icy blasts that hindered her footing and prevented a frontal assault."
    "当[hon]准备发动更猛烈的连击时，我用一连串冰爆术打乱她的平衡，阻碍其步伐并封锁正面进攻的路线。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:519
translate chinese postros1_8908b923:

    # hon "Darn, sugarcube! Sparring with you keeps me on my toes! Literally!"
    hon "真见鬼，甜心！和你切磋真是半点不能松懈！字面意义上的！"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:523
translate chinese postros1_fc91b4ca:

    # "Despite the fact I was only human, I was somehow keeping up. It felt amazing."
    "尽管只是人类之躯，我却能与之抗衡。这种感觉太棒了。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:525
translate chinese postros1_b7e19417:

    # ori "And this is the exact kind of thing you’ll have to expect from Umbra. He’s a unicorn too, after all."
    ori "而这正是Umbra会使用的战术。毕竟他也是角马。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:526
translate chinese postros1_c5c80aed:

    # "At this point, Orion would no longer spar with all three of at once. We were too strong. We’d pair off into unique groups instead and go all out."
    "到后来，Orion不再同时与我们三个对练。我们变得太强了，于是分成不同组合全力切磋。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:528
translate chinese postros1_3873c7d3:

    # "On the magical side of things, thanks to [aug]’s guidance, [rub], [bla] and I excelled."
    "在魔法方面，多亏[aug]的指导，[rub]，[bla]和我都进步显著。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:533
translate chinese postros1_dce3ebf3:

    # "We sparred there too. My physical prowess constantly gave me an advantage, forcing the casters to stay on the defensive."
    "我们也在那里练习。我的体能优势持续压制着她们，迫使她们始终采取守势。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:534
translate chinese postros1_06c12c32:

    # "Which is where they were also at their strongest. I took a few hits from [rub]’s shield."
    "而这也正是她们最强的领域。[rub]的荆棘护盾让我吃了不少苦头。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:535
translate chinese postros1_2abd134d:

    # "But thankfully, [aug] was one of the best healers in the country, so we were back in action within minutes."
    "但幸好[aug]是全国最顶尖的治疗师之一，几分钟内就能让我们恢复到战斗状态。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:537
translate chinese postros1_07e3c314:

    # "Finally… the day of confrontation arrived. It's time to go to Cadia Falls."
    "最终…对决之日来临。是时候前往Cadia瀑布了。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:544
translate chinese blankday_408f7a13:

    # "In the morning, I didn't feel like doing anything at all."
    "早上起来时，我根本提不起劲做任何事。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:546
translate chinese blankday_d9b66acc:

    # "I spent the morning researching my leads and planning my next moves."
    "整个上午我都在研究线索并规划下一步行动。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:550
translate chinese blankday_356b11b2:

    # "I spent the morning relaxing."
    "整个上午我都在放松休息。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:552
translate chinese blankday_50085bc8:

    # "I spent the early morning preparing."
    "我趁清晨时分做了些准备工作。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:606
translate chinese nightevent_5e9b3b9d:

    # "As [mox] and I got into bed, the entire thing suddenly began to shake. Another earthquake."
    "当[mox]和我刚躺上床，整个屋子突然开始摇晃。又一场地震。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:608
translate chinese nightevent_68b7f075:

    # mox "You’re not vibrating, are you?"
    mox "该不会是你在抖吧？"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:609
translate chinese nightevent_da2d9e9d:

    # mc "I don’t think so."
    mc "我觉得不是。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:611
translate chinese nightevent_91172884:

    # mox "Damn, I kind of wish you could."
    mox "唉，我倒希望真是你在抖呢。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:612
translate chinese nightevent_b893bfc0:

    # mc "I’m seriously wondering why this universe has earthquakes."
    mc "我真搞不懂为什么这个宇宙会有地震。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:614
translate chinese nightevent_5f16f243:

    # mox "I heard from someone that they’re technically not earthquakes, which are when tectonic plates in the earth move against each other or something."
    mox "听说这严格上来讲不算地震，地震是地壳板块相互碰撞造成的。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:616
translate chinese nightevent_501745e6:

    # mox "Instead the entire planet is shaking."
    mox "现在是整个星球在震动。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:617
translate chinese nightevent_ec4671e1:

    # mc "What? The {i}entire{/i} planet?"
    mc "什么？{i} 整个 {/i}星球？"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:619
translate chinese nightevent_860c8d2e:

    # mox "I mean, just a theory. But these ‘earthquakes’ are global."
    mox "只是个推测。但这些\"地震\"确实是全球性的。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:620
translate chinese nightevent_b75b1465:

    # mc "Man… This universe is something else."
    mc "老天…这个宇宙真是奇怪啊。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:644
translate chinese nightevent_3756f425:

    # "[mc], are you there? I don’t have long."
    "[mc]，你在听吗？我时间不多了。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:645
translate chinese nightevent_1de57ac1:

    # "A shimmering figure with a familiar voice appeared before me."
    "一道闪着微光的身影伴随着熟悉的声音出现在我面前。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:646
translate chinese nightevent_50b3b016:

    # "You’re doing so good so far – keep meeting with the virtues, so they can reach their potential."
    "你目前做得很好——继续与谐律之元们见面，帮助她们激发潜能。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:647
translate chinese nightevent_781fa6a4:

    # "And with that, hopefully, this –"
    "坚持下去，但愿——"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:653
translate chinese nightevent_fa496812:

    # "Ack?! How could the dream end right there?"
    "啊？！怎么偏偏在这种时候梦醒？"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:654
translate chinese nightevent_54895896:

    # "That woman though… I only know one person that was able to comfortably enter people’s dreams to communicate with them, and since this is the third dream of its type in a row, I can’t put it down to coincidence."
    "不过那个女性…我只认识一为雌驹能随意进入他人的梦境中与之沟通，加上这是连续第三次做这类梦，绝不可能只是巧合。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:655
translate chinese nightevent_58d2b137:

    # "Princess [sel] is trying to communicate with me – but… this is a world without Princess [sel]."
    "[sel]公主正试图联系我——但…这是个不存在[sel]公主的世界。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:660
translate chinese nightevent_31fcf07a:

    # "Just as we’re getting into bed, I remember my dream from the prior night."
    "刚躺上床时，我想起了前夜的梦。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:661
translate chinese nightevent_cfae12c8:

    # mc "[mox], I had a small question for you."
    mc "[mox]，有个小问题想问你。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:663
translate chinese nightevent_746d806a:

    # mox "You can ask me anything you want, darling."
    mox "想问什么都可以哦，亲爱的。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:664
translate chinese nightevent_346183de:

    # mc "It’s just… I’ve kind of asked you this before, but it’s about a Princess [sel]."
    mc "只是…虽然之前问过类似的问题，是关于[sel]公主的。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:666
translate chinese nightevent_dbb47146:

    # mox "Yeah, I’ve never heard of her before. It’s hard to imagine that I’m blood related to someone like that."
    mox "嗯，从没听说过有这位公主。很难想象我会和她有血缘关系。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:667
translate chinese nightevent_87c5ba8b:

    # mc "Hm… She’s supposed to be [aur]’s sister, the Princess of the Moon."
    mc "唔…她应该是[aur]的妹妹，月之公主。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:669
translate chinese nightevent_fdbdf9c3:

    # mox "A Queen of the Sun and a sister Princess of the Moon would certainly make a lot of sense."
    mox "太阳女王与月亮公主的姐妹设定确实很合理。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:670
translate chinese nightevent_47658910:

    # mc "She’s been appearing in my dreams, asking me to gather the virtues. Although I haven’t quite figured out why, I can only imagine it’s related to solving the troubles around the world."
    mc "她一直出现在我梦里，要求我集结谐律之元们。虽然还没完全明白原因，但想必与解决世界危机有关。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:672
translate chinese nightevent_60c92be7:

    # mox "It sounds like we need to get that meeting with [aur] and fast!"
    mox "看来得尽快安排与[aur]会面了！"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:673
translate chinese nightevent_b675f12e:

    # mc "You’re right. I’ll ask her for help directly."
    mc "你说得对。我会直接向她求助。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:693
translate chinese nightevent_7de01b36:

    # "You see it too, don't you?"
    "你也看到了，对吧？"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:694
translate chinese nightevent_3f14e30d:

    # "The sky is falling."
    "天空正在坠落"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:696
translate chinese nightevent_53302757:

    # "You're doing great."
    "你做得很好。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:697
translate chinese nightevent_0c9fffe7:

    # "Keep it up, and we can save them all."
    "继续保持，我们就能拯救世界。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:699
translate chinese nightevent_ab4aa7aa:

    # "Another nightmare... No, I can't pretend these are nightmares anymore. This was another message from the princess."
    "又一场噩梦…不，不能再自欺欺人了。这是公主的另一条信息。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:700
translate chinese nightevent_1e3ccf46:

    # "While I might not completely understand what's happening yet, I'll put my faith in her."
    "虽然还不完全明白现状，但我愿意相信她。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:702
translate chinese nightevent_760032c8:

    # mox "Are you okay, babe?"
    mox "你还好吗，宝贝？"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:703
translate chinese nightevent_59d08802:

    # mc "Just a little faint, nothing to worry about."
    mc "只是有点头晕，别担心。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:705
translate chinese nightevent_c9b9e881:

    # mox "You've been working so hard lately. Remember to live a little of your own life too."
    mox "最近你太辛苦了。记得也要过一点属于自己的生活。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:706
translate chinese nightevent_16a240ed:

    # "Live a little of my own life... Specific, carefully worded, and deeply true."
    "过一点属于自己的生活…措辞精准而深刻，直抵真相。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:708
translate chinese nightevent_26f5b4a8:

    # "[mox] lays back down."
    "[mox]重新躺下。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:709
translate chinese nightevent_bf9b2bc2:

    # "She never fails to impress me. In so few words, she's made me realize something crucial that I've been overlooking."
    "她总能让我惊叹。寥寥数语就让我意识到自己一直忽略了某个关键点。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:710
translate chinese nightevent_53ba577f:

    # "I'm spending so much time and effort chasing my old life, that I never considered how it'd make those around me feel."
    "我花了太多精力追逐过去的生活，却从未考虑身边人的感受。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:711
translate chinese nightevent_3a5ad960:

    # "And so what if I'm successful? I just disappear forever? How would that make [mox] feel?"
    "就算成功又怎样？永远消失吗？[mox]会怎么想？"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:712
translate chinese nightevent_a343b492:

    # "Maybe... this is my life now, and I need to accept that."
    "或许…这就是我现在的人生，我需要接受现实。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:716
translate chinese nightevent_22e5fd2a:

    # "I get into bed, and [mox] snuggles up beside me as we doze off together."
    "我躺上床，[mox]依偎过来，我们相拥入眠。"

# game/4.7 - Day Events.rpy:718
translate chinese nightevent_4717a7a8:

    # "I get into bed, and even though we have separate bedrooms, [mox] still finds herself snuggled up beside me."
    "我躺上床时，尽管各有卧室，[mox]还是钻过来依偎在我身边。"

